{"data": [{"author_id": "1828210046938812416", "created_at": "2026-10-28T05:51:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115320470044115395"], "id": "2115320470044115395", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 49, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "CXMT is starting limited HBM3E production in the next two months at yields of just 20% to 30%.\n\nSK Hynix, the market leader, runs at around 70%. CXMT's chips have already gone out as samples to Chinese AI chip designers, and in testing their performance sits closer to", "url": "https://x.com/sphinx_thesis/status/2115320470044115395"}, {"author_id": "2070031994831196160", "created_at": "2026-10-28T06:30:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115330346698801218"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/nLWXNJqeGY", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LearnInvest2026/status/2115330346698801218/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115330344954023936", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/nLWXNJqeGY"}]}, "id": "2115330346698801218", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 33, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$6.5 Trillion Hangs on Rare Earths, and Half of It Is Cars, Not Chips\n\nThe International Energy Agency estimates that if China's rare earth export controls were fully enforced, about $6.5 trillion of downstream production outside China would be exposed. Within that figure, the https://t.co/nLWXNJqeGY", "url": "https://x.com/LearnInvest2026/status/2115330346698801218"}, {"author_id": "2035424540965363712", "created_at": "2026-10-28T02:35:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115271227455713681"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/EpochAIResearc…", "end": 129, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/EpochAIResearch/status/2115186242459767006", "start": 106, "url": "https://t.co/3m5Y9vXgBx"}]}, "id": "2115271227455713681", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 139, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115186242459767006", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The US is growing its dominance in AI compute share thanks to TSMC, NVIDIA, and ASML and export controls. https://t.co/3m5Y9vXgBx", "url": "https://x.com/LunarThinkTrade/status/2115271227455713681"}, {"author_id": "770325773127258113", "created_at": "2026-10-28T02:35:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115271085201436801"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 9, "start": 3, "tag": "China"}]}, "id": "2115271085201436801", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "1/ #China’s proposed expansion of export controls to cover 23 core AI technologies, advanced models, and semiconductor manufacturing components is a major structural shift.\n\nHere is what this means for capital allocators, deep-tech founders, and cross-border supply chains.", "url": "https://x.com/NairVentures/status/2115271085201436801"}, {"author_id": "1469854136615116800", "created_at": "2026-10-28T04:31:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115300273401032819"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/GEajEWayGx", "end": 271, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/sohelhussaing/status/2115300273401032819/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115067093406416896", "start": 248, "url": "https://t.co/GEajEWayGx"}]}, "id": "2115300273401032819", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI infrastructure is becoming a geopolitical issue, not just an engineering issue.\n\nFact: China proposed export controls covering AI models, agents, computing clusters, and other technologies on October 16. The proposal is subject to consultation. https://t.co/GEajEWayGx", "url": "https://x.com/sohelhussaing/status/2115300273401032819"}, {"author_id": "1859780116014141440", "created_at": "2026-10-28T04:24:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115298592323776933"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Anthropic’s IPO filing warns that its AI models and agents could enable cyberattacks and create legal, regulatory and insurance risks. The company also says…", "display_url": "cyber.hendryadrian.com/article/10539/…", "end": 268, "expanded_url": "https://cyber.hendryadrian.com/article/10539/anthropic-ipo-filing-details-cybersecurity-risks-from-its-ai-models", "images": [{"height": 4024, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115298601991614464/WGgvgW0D?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 6048}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115298601991614464/WGgvgW0D?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 245, "status": 200, "title": "Anthropic IPO Filing Details Cybersecurity Risks From Its AI Models", "unwound_url": "https://cyber.hendryadrian.com/article/10539/anthropic-ipo-filing-details-cybersecurity-risks-from-its-ai-models", "url": "https://t.co/mVgpk8oDc1"}]}, "id": "2115298592323776933", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 195, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anthropic’s IPO filing warns that its AI models and agents could enable cyberattacks and create legal, regulatory and insurance risks. The company also says its safeguards may have gaps and cites export controls and an FTC investigative demand.\nhttps://t.co/mVgpk8oDc1", "url": "https://x.com/TweetThreatNews/status/2115298592323776933"}, {"author_id": "1214528593", "created_at": "2026-10-28T00:44:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115243223388147779"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/willdepue/stat…", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/willdepue/status/2115236836092313988", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/7cCL0zr09S"}]}, "id": "2115243223388147779", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 2812, "like_count": 36, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115236836092313988", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "There are legislators who are really on top of export controls, and others who are really on top of frontier AI safety, but no one has really set out to make this their top issue (AI security in the original sense, not safety rebranded as security).\n\nI hope that changes soon! https://t.co/7cCL0zr09S", "url": "https://x.com/Miles_Brundage/status/2115243223388147779"}, {"author_id": "731152829289762816", "created_at": "2026-10-28T05:26:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115314268971340157"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/G41aiT6Yuk", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SemiconductorsX/status/2115314268971340157/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115314260951900160", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/G41aiT6Yuk"}]}, "id": "2115314268971340157", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 2006, "like_count": 21, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "China’s CXMT is set to start limited production of advanced high-bandwidth memory even though most of the chips it makes do not work.\n\nReuters cites two people familiar with the matter. The company plans to begin making HBM3E over the next two months. Only about 20% to 30% of the https://t.co/G41aiT6Yuk", "url": "https://x.com/SemiconductorsX/status/2115314268971340157"}, {"author_id": "2083499892144836609", "created_at": "2026-10-28T06:59:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115337689448984874", "2115343625450037297"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/EX9IprzEph", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i_am_contagion/status/2115337689448984874/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115337479884857345", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/EX9IprzEph"}]}, "id": "2115337689448984874", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 37, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "China’s CXMT is planning to start limited production of the current version, HBM3E, within the next two months.\n\nBut the factory output tells a different story.\n\nLet's start with yield: it's simply the share of chips that come off the line and actually work. At CXMT right now, https://t.co/EX9IprzEph", "url": "https://x.com/i_am_contagion/status/2115337689448984874"}, {"author_id": "1878672749171994624", "created_at": "2026-10-28T06:15:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115326645976371609"], "id": "2115326645976371609", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Reuters: China’s CXMT plans limited HBM3E production within ~2 months — at 20–30% yields.\n\nSK hynix runs around ~70%. In testing, CXMT’s “HBM3E” is reportedly closer to prior-gen HBM3 performance. Samples already with domestic AI chip designers.\n\nUnder export controls, China is", "url": "https://x.com/Leon99AI/status/2115326645976371609"}, {"author_id": "1511104418590048261", "created_at": "2026-10-28T03:14:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115280907330560139"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/uDcKMCEyDH", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/l_bohlman/status/2115280907330560139/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115280901810839552", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/uDcKMCEyDH"}]}, "id": "2115280907330560139", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 96, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Headline.\nAnthropic is the AI company behind Claude. It is getting ready to go public. Like other big AI companies, it needs huge amounts of electricity for its data centers. In its IPO paperwork it says natural gas is one of the main ways it will power those centers for now, https://t.co/uDcKMCEyDH", "url": "https://x.com/l_bohlman/status/2115280907330560139"}, {"author_id": "1856667903967330304", "create